# Claude Code Configuration Templates

Use these templates to configure your `.claude/settings.json` file, which you must create yourself within this (.claude/) directory.

## Option 1: AskSage Integration
Use this configuration if you are using the enterprise Ask
Sage API. **Never commit your actual API key to this repository.**

```json
{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "https://api.nnsa.asksage.ai/server/anthropic",
    "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "YOUR_ASKSAGE_API_KEY",
    "ANTHROPIC_MODEL" : "[insert_local_model]", # recommend Haiku 5.5 as default
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC": "1"
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS": "1",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY": "0",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_ATTRIBUTION_HEADER": "0",
  },
}
```

## Option 2: Local Model Integration (Ollama)
Use this configuration to use locally running models via Ollama. There are other ways to do this, but this is the quickest way to get started for now.
**Prerequisites:** Ollama installed on your host machine and running. Recommended model: `gemma4:12b-it-q4_K_M` for most work; `gemma4:26b` for more complext work. Models must be able to handle context window of at least 64k (Claude Code requirement)

```json
{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "http://host.docker.internal:11434", (if using docker)
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "http://127.0.0.1:11434", (if not using docker)
    "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "ollama",
    "ANTHROPIC_MODEL" : "[insert_local_model]",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL": "[insert_local_model]",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL": "[insert_local_model]",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL": "[insert_local_model]",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS": "1",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC": "1",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_ATTRIBUTION_HEADER": "0",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY": "0",
    "HF_TELEMETRY_DISABLED": "1",
    "OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD": "1",
  },
  "prefersReducedMotion": false,
  "switchModelsOnFlag": true,
  "terminalProgressBarEnabled": true
  "model": "[insert_local_model]" # should match ANTHROPIC_MODEL
}
```

## Attributions, Permissions
Add this block to your `.claude/settings.json` for additional permissions settings . Command paths assume a Linux/WSL2 environment; adjust the path prefix if running in a different container or VM.

```json
  "attribution": {
    "commit": "",
    "pr": ""
  },
   "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(uv run *)",
      "Bash(* npm run *)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Delete",
      "Bash(git add -A)",
      "Bash(git add .)",
      "Bash(git add -all)",
      "Bash(git add -f)",
      "Bash(*--no-verify*)",
      ".env",
      ".env.local",
      ".env.*.local",
      "* ASKSAGE_USER_BASE_URL *",
      "* docker push *",
      "* github.com *",
      "*git push*-f*",
      "*git push*--force*",
      "*git push*--force-with-lease*",
      "*git reset*--hard*",
      "*git checkout*--*",
      "*git*-f*commit*",
      "*git*-f*branch*",
      "*git*-f*rebase*"
    ]
  },
  "plansDirectory": ".claude/plans",
  "autoMemoryDirectory": ".claude/memory",
  "agents": {
    "slice-orchestrator": {"path": ".claude/agents/slice-orchestrator.md"},
    "feature-builder": {"path": ".claude/agents/feature-builder.md"},
    "code-reviewer": {"path": ".claude/agents/code-reviewer.md"},
    "mcp-workflow": {"path": ".claude/agents/mcp-workflow.md"},
    "mcp-builder": {"path": ".claude/agents/mcp-builder.md"},
    "mcp-eval": {"path": ".claude/agents/mcp-eval.md"},
    "tdd-enforcer": {"path": ".claude/agents/tdd-enforcer.md"},
    "interrogator": {"path": ".claude/agents/interrogator.md"},
    "git-safety-constraint-agent": {"path": ".claude/agents/git-safety-constraint-agent.md"},
    "agentic-minimum-cd-guru": {"path": ".claude/agents/agentic-minimum-cd-guru.md"}
  },
}
```

## Hooks (PreToolUse / PostToolUse)
Add this `hooks` block to your `.claude/settings.json` to wire all guard hooks and quality checks. Command paths assume a Linux/WSL2 environment; adjust the path prefix if running in a different container or VM.

```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 -S \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/tool_call_context.py\" session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 -S \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/tool_call_context.py\" prompt",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Edit|Write|Glob|Grep|NotebookEdit|TodoWrite|Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 -S \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/tool_input_preflight.py\"",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Edit|Write|Glob|Grep|NotebookEdit|TodoWrite|Bash|Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 -S \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/tool_failure_recovery.py\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
